{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41156","headline":"星回节避风台骠信命赋 · 赵叔达","name":"星回节避风台骠信命赋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"法驾避星回，波罗毘勇猜。\n河润冰难合，地暖梅先开。\n下令俚柔洽，献賝弄栋来。\n愿将不才质，千载侍游台。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵叔达","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41156.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41156","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}